	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00048" index="48">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup. Oh, you must be new.\nWelcome to the Athlete Shop!\rYou and your homies been workin’ out?\rFlyin’ sweat!\nBreathin’ in sync!\fFresh friendship!\fStinky jerseys!\rSpend your Athlete Points here on\nprizes!\rLemme say it again.\nWelcome to the Athlete Shop! {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00049" index="49">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Welcome to the Athlete Shop! {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00050" index="50">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">We closed for the day.\nCome back tomorrow for a whole new\fbatch of prizes!\fSame prizes. New batch.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00051" index="51">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Good looks, come back soon.\nStretch before you leave.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00052" index="52">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Your scores in the Pokéathlon...\nThe proof of your bond with your\fhomies, so to speak, get you\fAthlete Points.\rYou can trade ’em here for\nall kinds of prizes.\rScore as much as you can and come back\nhere for prizes!\rAnything else I can do\nfor you? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00053" index="53">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Welcome!\rThis where we keep the Pokéathlon\ndatabase.\rUse a Data Card at the monitor to\ncheck your records.\rSome is impressive, and some is...\nembarrassin’. Mostly embarrassin’.\rYou wanna buy a Data Card with\nPokéathlon records on it? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00054" index="54">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Welcome!\rWe sell Data Cards with\nPokéathlon records on ’em here.\rYou wanna buy a Data Card? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00055" index="55">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Giggle!\nTruth is, I know a LOT about you!\fLike, a LOT a lot.\fLemme see...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00056" index="56">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You done entered\nthe Pokéathlon...\f{STRVAR_1 51, 0, 0} times!\fGiggle!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00057" index="57">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You done entered the Pokéathlon...\fSheesh, OVER 100 TIMES!\rBravo!\nTouch grass sometime.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00058" index="58">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Like I just showed, the Pokéathlon\ndatabase know EVERYTHING.\fWe know what you ate today.\rYou can trade your Athlete Points for\na Data Card and check your records\fon the monitor next to me.\rAnything else I can do for you? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00059" index="59">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Good looks. Come back soon!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00060" index="60">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup, Pokéathlete {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\rYou workin’ on breakin’ your own\nrecords? You can check your records\fon the monitor next to me.\rPeep it every now and then!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00061" index="61">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">We outta Data Cards.\nBut don’t be sad.\rMore Data Cards comin’!\nThe truck late. The truck always late.\fCome back later.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00062" index="62">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">We outta Data Cards.\nBut don’t be sad.\rMore Data Cards comin’...\nOr not!\rYou collected ALL the Data Cards!\nWonderful!\rYou a true Pokéathlete,\n{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\rKeep workin’ on breakin’\nyour own records!\rGood looks for comin’!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00063" index="63">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">So they got TEN events?\n...Which homie I’mma pick?\fI only got one homie. It’s a SUNKERN.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00064" index="64">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There’s five Pokéathlon courses!\rSpeed, Power, Stamina, Jump, and\nSkill.\rPick your homies carefully.\nDon’t bring a SLOWPOKE to Speed.\fI did. We came in sixth. Of four.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00065" index="65">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Some homies good at Speed events.\nSome ain’t. Build a team that cover\feach other.\fLike a group project, except\feverybody actually do their part.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00066" index="66">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Keep goin’ and you’ll see the Museum\nof Pokéathlete Records.\rOne day I’mma have a record in there!\nMost Naps Taken During An Event.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00067" index="67">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Your score turn into Athlete Points,\nand you trade ’em for prizes.\rEven if you finish dead last,\nyour score still count!\fParticipation trophy energy.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00068" index="68">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">“Hurdle Dash”\rMad Hurdles waitin’ on your homies!\nBe faster than everybody! Jump the\fHurdles and go for number one!\fDon’t trip. It’s on camera.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00069" index="69">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">“Pennant Capture”\rPennants hidden on the beach.\nFight over ’em and bring back as many\fas you can! Snatch ’em! Legally!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00070" index="70">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">“Circle Push”\rTime to show off your homie’s Power!\nPush ’em out and stay in the Circle!\fLike the club on a Friday.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00071" index="71">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">“Block Smash”\rA mountain of Blocks waitin’ on\nyour homies! SMASH ’em all!\fAnger management, but it’s a sport.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00072" index="72">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">“Disc Catch”\rDiscs get thrown at you. Jump and\ncatch ’em in the air!\rDon’t get boxed in. Catch as many\nas you can! Like a dog at the park.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00073" index="73">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">“Lamp Jump”\rYou never know how high you gon’\nbounce! Use Jump and Skill to score!\fDon’t hit the ceilin’. Again.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00074" index="74">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">“Relay Run”\rKeep runnin’ till you can’t run no\nmore! Three homies, one W!\fPass the baton. Don’t drop it.\fWe see you, MEOWTH.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00075" index="75">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">“Ring Drop”\rHomies tackle! Push past your Stamina\nand stay in the Ring!\fBasically wrestlin’. WWE rules.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00076" index="76">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">“Snow Throw”\rA field colder than your ex,\nMILLIONS of Snowballs waitin’!\rAim and throw!\nTime it right! No ice in ’em!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00077" index="77">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">“Goal Roll”\rPut your whole heart into hittin’ the\nball! Attack! Defend your Goal!\rAim for the other Goals!\nWho gon’ get the W?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00078" index="78">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Work with your homies. Believe in ’em\nand help ’em believe in you!\fBelieve in their potential.\fLet the friendship lead your team!\rThe Pokéathlon always with you!\fThat’s on the gym wall. Every gym.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00079" index="79">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Charge up with friendship!\nGive Aprijuice to your homies!\fThey sponsor me. I gotta say it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00080" index="80">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Whitney: AYO, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}! You here for\nthe Pokéathlon? Me too!\rI been SO hype since they built it.\nIt’s RIGHT by Goldenrod, you know?\fI can walk here! I don’t, but I can!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00081" index="81">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Huh?\rYou was finna enter the Pokéathlon\nlookin’ like THAT?\rYou ain’t prepared at ALL, huh?\rSo...\nYou a medium or a small?\fYou look more like a medium...\fNo offense.\rOK! I’mma get you a jersey that fit!\rYou gotta look your BEST in the\nPokéathlon, right?\rWait right there!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00082" index="82">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This fit you PERFECT!\nI’m good at this. I’m good at\feverythin’.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00083" index="83">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} got a jersey!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00084" index="84">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You look perfect.\nNow that you ready, I’mma...\rOh, NO!\nWhere my homies at?!\rI left ’em at the food court.\nSee ya!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00085" index="85">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The vendin’ machine is for\nparticipants! You can even use\fAthlete Points. {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00086" index="86">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Which drink you want? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00087" index="87">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Clang!\rA can of {STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0} dropped down.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00088" index="88">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Clang!\rBonus! Another can of {STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0}\ndropped down.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00089" index="89">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Not enough bread...\nThe machine judgin’ you.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00090" index="90">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Not enough points...\nGo jump around some more.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00091" index="91">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Decided not to buy a drink.\nHydration is for the weak.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00092" index="92">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Openin’ the Pokéathlon Data...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00093" index="93">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Which data you wanna see? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00094" index="94">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">OVERALL DATA {ALN_CENTER}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00095" index="95">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">EVENT DATA {ALN_CENTER}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00096" index="96">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">ACTION DATA {ALN_CENTER}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00097" index="97">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">EXIT {ALN_CENTER}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00098" index="98">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Accessin’......</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00099" index="99">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Accessin’............</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00100" index="100">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Accessin’..................</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00101" index="101">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Good looks for accessin’!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00102" index="102">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Welcome to the Museum Shop!\nEverything in here overpriced.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00103" index="103">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sheesh, you got good eyes! Can I tell\nyou about my last dream? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00104" index="104">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hmmm... My sharp eyes musta got\nweak... Or you just rude.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00105" index="105">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I used to LOVE Jump events.\rMy record back when I was active\nis 998 jumps!\rJust two more!\nAll I needed was TWO more!\rThen my knees said no.\nForever.\rCould you jump 1,000 times for me?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00106" index="106">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The record might make you dizzy.\nBut you still young. Your knees good.\fYou can do it!\rI’ll just sit here and wait.\nI got time. I got nothin’ but time.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00107" index="107">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh! YOU!\nThat’s so wonderful of you!\fYou jumped 1,000 times!\rGood looks, fr!\nHere’s a lil somethin’ to say\fthanks. My knees good looks too.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00108" index="108">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m your fan now. I’m old as you\nsee, but I got your back.\fI can’t run to help. But I’ll yell.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00109" index="109">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know what?\nI FINALLY tackled over 500 times!\fMy chiropractor is RICH.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00110" index="110">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Haha!\nYou doin’ fine, but not as good as\fme. I wonder if ANY Pokéathlete could\ftackle better than me.\fSigh... it’s lonely at the top.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00111" index="111">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know what?\nI tackled over 1,000 times!\fFinally! I can’t feel my arms!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00112" index="112">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know what? I FINALLY tackled\nover 2,000 times! Bet NOBODY breakin’\fthat record easy!\fI’m untouchable!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00113" index="113">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">......!\nNo! That ain’t right!\fYour record beat MINE?\rNooooo!\n...Aight. You win.\rI admit total defeat.\nTake this. And take my dignity.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0138_D49R0101_00114" index="114">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Whew!\nIt’s weird, but I feel GREAT.\rI’m salty I lost, but it showed me\nwhere I’m at.\rThere’s a lotta Pokéathletes better\nthan me.\rThis where I start grindin’ again!\nKeep it up! Watch your back!</language>
	</row>
</body>
